  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "This adult-male Megaloceros giganteus has broad palmated bare antlers above a robust, long-legged deer body. Coat, colour, stance and precise antler details are interpretive, allowing individual variation rather than asserting a fixed specimen-exact pattern.",
    "zh": "此成年雄性大角鹿 Megaloceros giganteus 具有结实的长腿鹿体和宽阔掌状的无茸鹿角。毛被、颜色、站姿与精确角形细节为解释性复原，考虑个体差异，不主张固定的逐标本精确形态。"
  },
